.DS_Store

# Terraform. The provider lock file (.terraform.lock.hcl) is committed on purpose, as in
# SideNerdApps: it is what pins the provider version for everyone.
terraform/.terraform/
*.tfplan
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# Papers downloaded for reading. Third-party copyright: kept locally, never committed.
# What we take from them lives in REFERENCES.bib notes and ASSUMPTIONS.md, in our own words.
docs/reading/*.pdf

# Correspondence with physicists: private emails, letters and drafts. Kept locally, never committed
# (removed from the public tree on 2026-09-24; earlier commits still hold copies in git history).
docs/outreach/

# Local secrets (AWS keys etc.). Never commit: this repository is public.
.env
.env.*
